list.item:
Kissinger, Henry A., Assistant to the President
                        for National Security Affairs from January 1969 until November 1975;
                        Secretary of State from September 21, 1973 until January 20, 1977

Parker, Richard B., Chargé d’Affaires ad
                        interim to Algeria from November 12, 1974 until December 18, 1974;
                        Ambassador to Algeria from January 17, 1975 until February 12, 1977

Sullivan, William H., Deputy Assistant
                        Secretary of State for East Asian and Pacific Affairs until July 1973;
                        Ambassador to the Philippines from July 1973 until 1977

person.note:
Legal Adviser of the Department of State from November 1973 until July 1974;
                    Under Secretary of State for International Security Affairs from August 1974
                    until September 1976

Deputy Secretary of the Treasury from February 1973 until May 1974;
                    Administrator, Federal Energy Office, from December 1973 until April 1974;
                    Secretary of the Treasury from May 1974 until January 1977
